# Crystal Imperium play test: a chosen move starts at once (DECISIONS.md D40). New game settings
# (FAST BATTLES on); TYPHLOSION (Lv 50), the faster, against Whitney's lead (trainer 406):
# - from the frame A picks Swift to its animation: at most 6 frames (0.13.0's first build: 15, the
#   choice confirmed, the turn order, the move's checks and its "used" message a frame each);
# - from the end of Swift's HP bar to the opposing Pokemon's move animation: at most 6 frames (16);
# - the turn ends with the next action menu.
# gBattlerControllerFuncs+4 is the opposing Pokemon's controller, which runs its HP bar. The opposing
# Pokemon gets Battle Armor: a critical hit's message would come between Swift's HP bar and its move
# (the random numbers differ between emulators: VBA-M's Swift was a critical hit).
!new_game()
!give_mon(157, 50)
!no_care_packages()
!battle_trainer(406)
!wait_action_menu("action_menu", 3000)
![f"poke16 {{gBattleMons+{v['size'] + v['ability']}}} {v['armor']}" for v in [probe.resolve({'size': 'sizeof(struct BattlePokemon)', 'ability': 'offsetof(struct BattlePokemon, ability)', 'armor': 'ABILITY_BATTLE_ARMOR'})]]
press A
wait 16
shot 01_moves.png
hold A 1
within8 {gAnimScriptActive} 1 6 swift_animation_within_6_frames_of_a
shot 02_swift.png
within32 {gBattlerControllerFuncs+4} {Controller_WaitForHealthBar+1} 120 swift_hp_bar
within32 {gBattlerControllerFuncs+4} {OpponentBufferRunCommand@battle_controller_opponent} 60 swift_hp_bar_done
within8 {gAnimScriptActive} 1 6 opposing_animation_within_6_frames_of_the_hp_bar
shot 03_opposing_move.png
!wait_action_menu("next_action_menu", 900)
shot 04_next_turn.png
